Adobe’s Digita l Media Business Unit 
Adobe’s Di gital Media Business Unit focuses on advancing state of the art content and driving digital 
transformation of industries. It provides tools and services that enable individuals, small businesses,  and 
enterprises to create, publish, promote, manage and monetize  their content anywhere through the 
Adobe Creative Cloud  and Document Cloud .  
Adobe’s Digital Experience Business Unit 
Adobe’s Digital  Experience Business Unit provides solutions that empower businesses to make, manage, 
measure, and monetize online, offline, and multichannel business initiatives.  
Through the Adobe Experience Cloud which includes our Advertising, Analytics and Marketing Clouds, 
companies have everything they need to deliver a well -designed, personal  and consistent experience to 
